{"type":"message","id":"616e06e2","parentId":"58fd0ef2","timestamp":"2026-06-01T03:34:36.615Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the current 4 positions (DOT SHORT @1.189, ETH LONG @2004.33, XRP SHORT @1.3395, BTC SHORT @73252) first appear together at:\n- May 30, 16:00 (line 4313-4316)\n\nThey were opened between May 30, 15:00 and May 30, 16:00. Let me check the entries right before 16:00 to see the transition.\n\nLooking at line 4057-4058 at May 30, 15:00:\n- DOT SHORT: entry=1.191\n- ETH LONG: entry=2038.17\n\nSo DOT changed from 1.191 to 1.189 and ETH changed from 2038.17 to 2004.33 between 15:00-16:00 on May 30.\n\nNow let me summarize:\n- These 4 positions have been open since May 30 afternoon (around 15:00-16:00 on May 30)\n- Today is June 1, 11:32 AM\n- So they've been open for roughly 2 days (about 44-45 hours)\n\nThat IS quite a while! The position rotation has been stuck because BTC keeps trying to open but max positions are reached with 4/4.\n\nLet me now give the answer. \n\nTime summary:\n- DOT SHORT @1.189: opened ~May 30 15:xx-16:00 → ~44 hours\n- ETH LONG @2004.33: opened ~May 30 15:xx-16:00 → ~44 hours  \n- XRP SHORT @1.3395: opened ~May 30 15:xx-16:00 → ~44 hours\n- BTC SHORT @73252: opened ~May 30 15:xx-16:00 → ~44 hours\n\nSo all 4 positions are about 2 days old, give or take a few hours. That's indeed quite long for the system that normally rotates positions actively.\n\nThe monitor keeps logging \"BTC 已达最大持仓数，跳过开仓\" because it's full with 4/4 positions and can't open anything new without closing one first.\n\nThis could be a concern:\n1. Positions have been stuck unchanged for ~44 hours\n2. No rotation means potential missed opportunities and mounting risk\n3. The system's rotation mechanism seems to be waiting for better scores but nothing is triggering a close/replace\n\nLet me report this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"四个仓位都是 5 月 30 号下午 15-16 点之间开的，到现在已经**快 2 天了**，确实挺久了。\n\n正常情况下系统会轮换仓位，但这 44 小时里一直是 4/4 满仓，monitor 只能反复报「BTC 已达最大持仓数，跳过开仓」—— 没空位就换不进去，相当于卡住了。\n\n关键看你想不想手动干预。两个方向：\n\n- **不管它**：让系统继续自动跑，等某个币触发止盈止损自然腾出空位\n- **手动平掉弱的**：DOT 和 BTC 两个空单一直在亏（DOT -1.42%、BTC -0.94%），可以考虑手动处理腾位置\n\n你要动哪个？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":638,"output":1225,"cacheRead":42880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44743,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780284861279}}
