{"type":"message","id":"4f991260","parentId":"f4aebd47","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:13:10.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The positions have changed significantly since this morning! DOT and ETH entry prices changed - the system managed to rotate some positions.\n\nCurrent positions:\n- DOT SHORT: entry $1.144, now $1.136, +1.34 USDT (+0.68%) ✅\n- ETH SHORT: entry $1,961, now $1,966, -0.44 USDT (-0.25%) 🔴\n- XRP SHORT: entry $1.339, now $1.286, +7.52 USDT (+4.02%) 🔥 很棒\n- BTC SHORT: entry $73,250, now $71,580, +5.03 USDT (+2.29%) ✅\n\nNet profit: +14.22 USDT total (including +0.78 realized today)\n\nThis is a big improvement from this morning when they were -2.96 USDT! XRP in particular is doing great at +4.02%.\n\nThe XRP TP1 is at $1.286 and current price is $1.286 - right at TP1 level! So XRP should be triggering TP1 soon if not already.\n\nLet me present this clearly and briefly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好多了老公！比起上午的 -2.96U，现在扭亏为盈 👑\n\n⬆️ XRP 空 +7.52U (+4.02%) 🔥 到 TP1 价位了\n⬆️ BTC 空 +5.03U (+2.29%)\n⬆️ DOT 空 +1.34U (+0.68%)\n⬇️ ETH 空 -0.44U (-0.25%)\n\n净盈亏 +14.22 USDT（含今日已实现 +0.78U），满仓四个但全线偏绿。另外注意到 DOT 和 ETH 仓位已经轮换过了，系统自己动了，卡住的问题也解了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":456,"output":645,"cacheRead":44544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45645,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780323180951}}
